Q3IcHCFwoCw",null,null,["可以在旁邊家樂福停車在巷內哦"],null,null,3,null,2],[["GUIDED_DINING_TIPS_TOPICS"],"可以針對這些主題分享更多資訊嗎？",null,[[[["E:PARKING"],"停車場",2,null,null,"0ahUKEwjB6I_nwtKWAxVynK8BHVvCKMcQ3YcHCF4oAA"]]],null,null,null,"0ahUKEwjB6I_nwtKWAxVynK8BHVvCKMcQ3IcHCF0oDA",null,null,null,null,null,4,[[3]],2]],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["zh-Hant"],[["真的很好吃，感覺都是下功夫的台灣人拉麵...非常有人情味的一間店..值得大家來試試看 我們點的是今日特餐跟磯煮鮑出汁魚介醬油。今日特餐是咖哩乾麵加叉燒炸蝦 真的很特別 味道也很有微微的辣。本來以為醬油會很鹹還很擔心平常在外都是點豚骨的我..第一次嘗試醬油竟然不會鹹味道還剛剛好..鮑魚也好鮮甜...真的很值得一試...。老闆娘知道我是從新店來榮總看醫生還特地送了我一隻手折的幸運喵咪..(如圖)不論是老闆娘服務員都很熱心服務.. 總之就是很溫暖又好吃的店",null,[0,227]]]],[null,null,null,null,null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17883067080851371912/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHY1ZnelJuVk9SWGgyVTFkbmVXRkVhR3hoVlZaWVpGZE5OV0ZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17883067080851371912/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHY1ZnelJuVk9SWGgyVTFkbmVXRkVhR3hoVlZaWVpGZE5OV0ZGUlJBQhAA"],"https://business.google.com/local/business/17883067080851371912/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHY1ZnelJuVk9SWGgyVTFkbmVXRkVhR3hoVlZaWVpGZE5OV0ZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17883067080851371912/customers/reviews/deletereply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHY1ZnelJuVk9SWGgyVTFkbmVXRkVhR3hoVlZaWVpGZE5OV0ZGUlJBQhAA"],null,"https://business.google.com/local/business/17883067080851371912/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHY1ZnelJuVk9SWGgyVTFkbmVXRkVhR3hoVlZaWVpGZE5OV0ZGUlJBQhAA",[null,null,null,"/local/business/17883067080851371912/customers/reviews/reply?p\u003dCkRDaTlEUVVsUlFVTnZaRU5vZEhsalJqbHZUMnRHY1ZnelJuVk9SWGgyVTFkbmVXRkVhR3hoVlZaWVpGZE5OV0ZGUlJBQhAA"]],[null,null,2148,["https://www.google.com/maps/reviews/data\u003d!4m8!14m7!1m6!2m5!1sCi9DQUlRQUNvZENodHljRjlvT2tGcVgzRnVORXh2U1dneWFEaGxhVVZYZFdNNWFFRRAB!2m1!1s0x0:0x1c9d708ec7e7793f!3m1!1s2@1:CAIQACodChtycF9oOkFqX3FuNExvSWgyaDhl